The subsystem shall identify whether an input file uses the WAV container 
format.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-009

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-016
TITLE: WAV File Decoding
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall decode supported audio streams contained within WAV files 
into PCM audio samples.
<<<
